  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TCPF: Technical Support for the update of Country Gender Assessment: Gender, Agriculture and Rural Develop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO will provide technical support in updating the Country Gender Assessment (CGA) under the ongoing GCP/GEO/012/AUS project. 
Responding to the Country Programming Framework priorities, an updated CGA will aim to provide a review of evidence on the issues of social equality and human well-being and provide recommendations for reaching the 2030 Agenda and National SDGs, including but not limited to reducing the disparities between urban and rural areas and increasing agricultural productivity.  The analysis will review existing policies contributing to sustainable food systems and identify the gaps and the needs in the context of gender inequalities, review the differentiated impacts of shocks and crises on rural women and men, such as the Covid-19 pandemic and implications of the war in Ukraine , climate change impactsagricultural productivity. , The updated CGA will also review promising practices in improving on-farm and off-farm income generation in rural areas through women s economic empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
